      "writtenOn": "2022-08-17T19:54:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ooh, I didn\u0027t notice that. I feel like a `peek` function should really not be mutating the data at all. That violates my expectations pretty significantly vs what a function named `peek` ought to do.\n\nCan we do the padding-up elsewhere, or make a dedicated function for it?",
      "parentUuid": "5d5c6dd2_c043580d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 156,
        "startChar": 23,
        "endLine": 156,
        "endChar": 38
      },
