      "writtenOn": "2022-08-17T19:07:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looks like this is relying on VLAs (by the book, these are C only)?\n\nIt\u0027s probably better to do something portable:\n\n```\nSkASSERT(paddingSize \u003c\u003d 16);\nstatic constexpr char kPadding[16] \u003d {};\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 554,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 554,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "7cc2f8148d500cf8d31a2d517adb91f7e8046f4f",
